# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# First, deliberately. See SECURITY.md and docs/THREAT-MODEL.md §B7.
# Belt and braces only — credentials should live outside the repo tree entirely.
*creds*
*credential*
*secret*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
priv_key*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.token
netmap-cache*

# ── Rust ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# ── Go ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/server/bin/
*.test
*.out
# `go build ./some/dir/` with no -o writes an executable named after the
# directory into the *current* one, so a stray build from server/ leaves a
# 39 MB binary next to the source. That is how server/testserver was very
# nearly committed into the vendored-fork commit.
/server/testserver
/server/karst-control

# ── Node ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Playwright run artefacts, written next to the specs.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# ── Tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
/result
.direnv/
CLAUDE.local.md

# ── Fuzzing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/
